        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/199dad499290df6b45a710b5f8e17d16.avif?t=1784071147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras_big/199dad499290df6b45a710b5f8e17d16.avif?t=1784071147 width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest sensation to hit Gensokyo, Volleyball, but this isn't an ordinary game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies are your court as you pick a team of two of your favorite Touhou characters. The pressure is on as you must not only keep the ball in play but avoid the bullets coming your way, all while countering with your own special attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/4f1f526ee80ddc356667dc5f5c37650a.poster.avif?t=1784071147\" width=694 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/4f1f526ee80ddc356667dc5f5c37650a.webm?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/4f1f526ee80ddc356667dc5f5c37650a.mp4?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic strikes Gensokyo as everyone wakes up to find their powers missing, including our resident incident solvers, Reimu and Marisa. But when Sakuya appears before them, a great revelation is made. A strange orb has appeared in Gensokyo with the power to take away and grant abilities  as it sees fit. Our heroines are on another case to challenge their friends in this new sport that has taken Gensokyo by storm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D arcade style sports game with 8 way movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First to reach match point or have the most points by time out is declared the winner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dash button allows you to streak across the screen while focus allows you to slow down to a crawl for careful placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball button allows you to hit the ball in various ways depending on how and when you press it along with direction buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack your opponent with projectiles, bombs, and a powerful desperation move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/ed0b95c7c0de058e4e2a4222332208da.poster.avif?t=1784071147\" width=694 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/ed0b95c7c0de058e4e2a4222332208da.webm?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/ed0b95c7c0de058e4e2a4222332208da.mp4?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play 2v2 in local or online multiplayer matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player modes such as story campaign and mini games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice and tutorial mode along with descriptions for every character to learn how to play the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A partner edit system where you can customize your CPU teammate from a list of commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support and up to two players on keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base roster of 14 of your favorite Touhou characters (with more on the way).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/c1a021c063e9c44aed9c17cc54a6584e.avif?t=1784071147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras_big/c1a021c063e9c44aed9c17cc54a6584e.avif?t=1784071147 width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/199dad499290df6b45a710b5f8e17d16.avif?t=1784071147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras_big/199dad499290df6b45a710b5f8e17d16.avif?t=1784071147 width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest sensation to hit Gensokyo, Volleyball, but this isn't an ordinary game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies are your court as you pick a team of two of your favorite Touhou characters. The pressure is on as you must not only keep the ball in play but avoid the bullets coming your way, all while countering with your own special attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/4f1f526ee80ddc356667dc5f5c37650a.poster.avif?t=1784071147\" width=694 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/4f1f526ee80ddc356667dc5f5c37650a.webm?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/4f1f526ee80ddc356667dc5f5c37650a.mp4?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic strikes Gensokyo as everyone wakes up to find their powers missing, including our resident incident solvers, Reimu and Marisa. But when Sakuya appears before them, a great revelation is made. A strange orb has appeared in Gensokyo with the power to take away and grant abilities  as it sees fit. Our heroines are on another case to challenge their friends in this new sport that has taken Gensokyo by storm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D arcade style sports game with 8 way movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First to reach match point or have the most points by time out is declared the winner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dash button allows you to streak across the screen while focus allows you to slow down to a crawl for careful placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball button allows you to hit the ball in various ways depending on how and when you press it along with direction buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack your opponent with projectiles, bombs, and a powerful desperation move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/ed0b95c7c0de058e4e2a4222332208da.poster.avif?t=1784071147\" width=694 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/ed0b95c7c0de058e4e2a4222332208da.webm?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/ed0b95c7c0de058e4e2a4222332208da.mp4?t=1784071147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play 2v2 in local or online multiplayer matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player modes such as story campaign and mini games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice and tutorial mode along with descriptions for every character to learn how to play the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A partner edit system where you can customize your CPU teammate from a list of commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support and up to two players on keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base roster of 14 of your favorite Touhou characters (with more on the way).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/c1a021c063e9c44aed9c17cc54a6584e.avif?t=1784071147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras_big/c1a021c063e9c44aed9c17cc54a6584e.avif?t=1784071147 width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
